        "node_id": "n_1_cdffa6",
        "thought_text": "Revised Thought-1: Instead of using binary search directly on the cumulative durations, iterate through the songs and their counts while decrementing the query value until it falls within the current song's duration range. This approach ensures accurate tracking of the currently playing song without relying on potentially incorrect binary search outcomes.",
